# nix-init: dotenv secrets backend
# Plaintext secrets, exported by direnv on entering this directory.
#
# This file is gitignored and MUST stay that way.  Unlike the sops backend,
# nothing here is encrypted at rest, and nothing scopes these to one process:
# direnv puts them in the environment of everything under this directory,
# which under envrc.el means every subprocess Emacs spawns in this project.
# Reach for the sops backend when that is too wide.

# EXAMPLE=value
